# Build context of the Keycloak image is the repository root; this file (next to
# the Dockerfile, picked up by BuildKit) restricts it to an allowlist: the realm
# definitions only. Applications, .env files, tooling such as .claude/ and the
# dev seed scripts never reach the image. Add new paths here deliberately.
*

!infra/keycloak/realms/

**/.DS_Store
**/.gitignore
